<p>Your mastery of necromancy becomes so total that an aura of undeath radiates around you in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8.</acronym></p><p>Any undead minion standing inside of it is protected, increasing all their resistances by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 11%, 13%, 16%, 18%.</acronym></p><p>In addition when you create new minions they inherit <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 24%, 29%, 33%, 36%</acronym> of your spellpower (applied to any powers), spell crit chance (applied to any crit chances), saves, resists and damage increases (applied to all elements).</p><p></p>